+          <dt pn="section-10.3-18.5">New state:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-10.3-18.6">Down</dd>
+          <dt pn="section-10.3-18.7">Action:</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-10.3-18.8">The Link state retransmission list, Database summary
